    "Connected, but the reply took %@ s. A dictation waits at most %d s for the rewrite, then pastes the text without it, so with this model most dictations won't be rewritten. Try a smaller or faster model.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connected, but the reply took %@ s. A dictation waits at most %d s for the rewrite, then pastes the text without it, so with this model most dictations won't be rewritten. Try a smaller or faster model."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connecté, mais la réponse a pris %@ s. Une dictée attend au plus %d s la réécriture, puis colle le texte sans elle : avec ce modèle, la plupart des dictées ne seront pas réécrites. Essayez un modèle plus petit ou plus rapide."
          }
        }
      }
    },
