    "Dictation in Cloudless is free and unlimited. Smart Cleanup, which fixes punctuation, formatting, numbers and filler words on your Mac, is what we charge for. Keeping it at the frontier, with the latest models running entirely on your Mac, is continuous work by a small team. A free app can't fund that; an ongoing relationship can.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dictation in Cloudless is free and unlimited. Smart Cleanup, which fixes punctuation, formatting, numbers and filler words on your Mac, is what we charge for. Keeping it at the frontier, with the latest models running entirely on your Mac, is continuous work by a small team. A free app can't fund that; an ongoing relationship can."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La dictée dans Cloudless est gratuite et illimitée. Ce que nous facturons, c'est Smart Cleanup, qui corrige la ponctuation, la mise en forme, les nombres et les mots de remplissage sur votre Mac. Le garder à la pointe, avec les derniers modèles exécutés entièrement sur votre Mac, est un travail continu pour une petite équipe. Une app gratuite ne peut pas financer cela ; une relation dans la durée, si."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dictation is free and unlimited.": {
