    "The first reply after the server loads a model is slower: test again to see its usual speed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first reply after the server loads a model is slower: test again to see its usual speed."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La première réponse après le chargement d’un modèle par le serveur est plus lente : testez à nouveau pour voir sa vitesse habituelle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model answered, but not with usable text. Try a different model or prompt.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model answered, but not with usable text. Try a different model or prompt."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle a répondu, mais pas avec un texte utilisable. Essayez un autre modèle ou prompt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model answered, but there was nothing between the output markers. Try a different model or prompt.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model answered, but there was nothing between the output markers. Try a different model or prompt."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle a répondu, mais il n’y avait rien entre les marqueurs de sortie. Essayez un autre modèle ou prompt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model's reply didn't contain %@. Check that the script asks for it, or change the markers under Show full script.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model's reply didn't contain %@. Check that the script asks for it, or change the markers under Show full script."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La réponse du modèle ne contenait pas %@. Vérifiez que le script le demande, ou changez les marqueurs sous Afficher le script complet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model's reply was much longer than the test sentence. It may have answered instead of rewriting. Try a different model or prompt.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model's reply was much longer than the test sentence. It may have answered instead of rewriting. Try a different model or prompt."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La réponse du modèle était bien plus longue que la phrase de test. Il a peut-être répondu au lieu de réécrire. Essayez un autre modèle ou un autre prompt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model's reply was much shorter than the test sentence. Try a different model or prompt.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model's reply was much shorter than the test sentence. Try a different model or prompt."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La réponse du modèle était bien plus courte que la phrase de test. Essayez un autre modèle ou un autre prompt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model's reply was cut off. Try a model that doesn't think at length, or a shorter prompt.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model's reply was cut off. Try a model that doesn't think at length, or a shorter prompt."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La réponse du modèle a été coupée. Essayez un modèle qui réfléchit moins longuement, ou une invite plus courte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server doesn't have a model called “%@”. Check the name, or download the model first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server doesn't have a model called “%@”. Check the name, or download the model first."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le serveur n’a pas de modèle nommé « %@ ». Vérifiez le nom, ou téléchargez d’abord le modèle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server doesn't recognise this address. Check the URL: OpenAI-compatible servers usually end in /v1.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server doesn't recognise this address. Check the URL: OpenAI-compatible servers usually end in /v1."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le serveur ne reconnaît pas cette adresse. Vérifiez l’URL : les serveurs compatibles OpenAI se terminent généralement par /v1."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server rejected the API key. Check that it's correct and still active.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server rejected the API key. Check that it's correct and still active."
          }
        },
