    "The server took too long to answer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server took too long to answer."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le serveur a mis trop de temps à répondre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server's reply couldn't be read. Is it an OpenAI-compatible API?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server's reply couldn't be read. Is it an OpenAI-compatible API?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La réponse du serveur est illisible. S’agit-il d’une API compatible OpenAI ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's a bigger reason too. Ask why there are so few great privacy-first products and the honest answer is that privacy-conscious users often refuse to pay for them, so they quietly die, while the apps that don't respect your privacy keep growing. Paying for Cloudless is a vote for products that don't send your personal data to the cloud and train models on it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There's a bigger reason too. Ask why there are so few great privacy-first products and the honest answer is that privacy-conscious users often refuse to pay for them, so they quietly die, while the apps that don't respect your privacy keep growing. Paying for Cloudless is a vote for products that don't send your personal data to the cloud and train models on it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il y a aussi une raison plus profonde. Demandez-vous pourquoi il existe si peu de bons produits respectueux de la vie privée : la réponse honnête, c'est que les utilisateurs soucieux de leur vie privée refusent souvent de payer pour eux. Ces produits disparaissent alors sans bruit, tandis que les applications qui ne respectent pas votre vie privée continuent de grandir. Payer pour Cloudless, c'est voter pour des produits qui n'envoient pas vos données personnelles dans le cloud pour y entraîner des modèles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These appear in the App Home \"Keep dictation local!\" carousel for every logged-in user.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These appear in the App Home \"Keep dictation local!\" carousel for every logged-in user."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces publications apparaissent dans le carrousel « Gardez la dictée locale ! » de l'accueil, pour tous les utilisateurs connectés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking or reasoning models (such as qwen3, deepseek-r1 or OpenAI's o-series) are slow for this and may return nothing. A small instruct model works best.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thinking or reasoning models (such as qwen3, deepseek-r1 or OpenAI's o-series) are slow for this and may return nothing. A small instruct model works best."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les modèles de réflexion ou de raisonnement (comme qwen3, deepseek-r1 ou la série o d’OpenAI) sont lents pour cela et peuvent ne rien renvoyer. Un petit modèle instruct fonctionne le mieux."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This allows Cloudless paste transcript into text fields.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This allows Cloudless paste transcript into text fields."
