    "We've set Pro at less than half of what the major cloud dictation products charge, and it's the only way we make money. We don't sell your data, because we never see it. Without paying users, there is no company and no next version.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We've set Pro at less than half of what the major cloud dictation products charge, and it's the only way we make money. We don't sell your data, because we never see it. Without paying users, there is no company and no next version."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nous avons fixé le prix de Pro à moins de la moitié de ce que facturent les principaux services de dictée dans le cloud, et c'est notre seule source de revenus. Nous ne vendons pas vos données, car nous ne les voyons jamais. Sans utilisateurs payants, il n'y a ni entreprise, ni prochaine version."
          }
        }
      }
    },
